'''Li'l Stages''' are Deadly-[[Stage Difficulties|difficulty]] [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]] unlocked after beating [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1, featuring [[No Continues]] and {{4c}} difficulty restrictions, only allowing the player to spawn [[:Category:Special Cats|Special]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]]. Cats from other categories can still be equipped to activate [[Cat Combo]]s. These stages give the [[True Form]]s of [[:Category:Li'l Cats|Li'l Cats]] as rewards. Most of these stages are very similar to the stages of the [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed/Manic]] counterpart of each Li'l Cat, and appear the day before these respective stages and from the 23rd to 25th.

==List of Li'l Stages==
*'''Li'l Cat Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Meows (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 2nd and 23rd day of every month.
*'''Li'l Tank Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Will (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 5th and 24th day of every month.
*'''Li'l Axe Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Chopper (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 8th and 25th day of every month.
*'''Li'l Gross Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Creeper (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 11th and 23rd day of every month.
*'''Li'l Cow Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Horns (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 14th and 24th day of every month.
*'''Li'l Bird Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Wings (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 17th and 25th day of every month.
*'''Li'l Fish Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Fins (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 20th and 23rd day of every month.
*'''Li'l Lizard Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Tail (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 23rd and 24th day of every month.
*'''Li'l Titan Awakens!''' - [[Tiny Fists (Deadly)]]: Accessible on the 25th and 26th day of every month.

==Trivia==
*These stages used to have a "Calamity" restriction line attached to their event icons, but it eventually got removed. This was probably since it was never used outside of Li'ls and just being there to denote already existing restrictions, or for the development of the Merciless difficulty.

